---
description: Put experimentations in /tmp, never in the repo.
alwaysApply: true
---

If you wanna do experimentations, just do in `/tmp/`.

Scratch builds, size probes, throwaway JS/Rust experiments, and measurement binaries go under `/tmp`. Do not leave experiment artifacts in the repo.

```
BAD: cargo new crates/size-probe
BAD: rustc probe.rs -o docs/researches/probe
GOOD: cargo new /tmp/size-probe
GOOD: rustc /tmp/probe.rs -o /tmp/probe
GOOD: node /tmp/probe.js
```
